{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"海關檢獲9隻走私貓狗　拘捕7人\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CUST-PC-261120-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】海關先後搗破2宗走私動物個案，涉及9隻貓狗，共拘捕7人。</p><p>海關在行動中檢獲7隻貓及2隻幼犬，市值約9萬元。</p><p>海關指早前發現有社交平台廣告，聲稱可提供寵物跨境運送，在本月5日一名女子經沙頭角中英街以膠袋偷運2隻貓入境，之後有私家車接應，將貓運到屯門一個商場外交收。另一宗發生在本周二，一名男子同樣經中英街過關，以單車裝載5隻貓及2隻狗。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.327076+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:07:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T02:17:14.850090+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:31.467459+00:00","content_hash":"8e557fe4d6e046e5f088db5c0e25917afa16514bd7e37d25da4d1297d27b3967","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.327076+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}